[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12246.309, "timestamp": "03:24:06", "text": "又多汁又美味。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12248.309, "timestamp": "03:24:08", "text": "但我希望草莓也能像这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12251.99, "timestamp": "03:24:11", "text": "比可爱更甜美。不，已经是这样了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12258.309, "timestamp": "03:24:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12262.309, "timestamp": "03:24:22", "text": "所以我们每天都得吃它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12271.91, "timestamp": "03:24:31", "text": "他没有走上前去。走上去。香蕉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12275.59, "timestamp": "03:24:35", "text": "正在做？你是什​​么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12276.92, "timestamp": "03:24:36", "text": "香蕉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12278.55, "timestamp": "03:24:38", "text": "[音乐]"}]